        "fields": {
          "notes": "CDLJ 2024:1 research Work by Hans J. Nissen, published 2024-05-30. The author explicitly frames it as a candid retrospective account of his relations and experiences with Uruk and as guidance about earlier excavation practice. Its evidential role is source-reported testimony and methodological critique. The article text is CC BY 4.0 except noted material; artifact images remain under separate CDLI terms."
